  "8b5ab953-8b7b-41f5-82cf-008912cd0b86"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the options a causal substrate is drawn with at a given size"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"5ecc62e8-e666-4225-9fb4-6b2800d1671c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
