    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/CausalSubstrateCode", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraCausality Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineGuideFunction",
  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "2dd74a61-42be-4fbd-b376-d17db788e310"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the held code that builds a named causal substrate"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"40bc7bd8-57fc-4253-9057-aa73ea93d4a5"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Random causal graphs", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"8288ec91-5d4e-4ef0-8985-0175e959f470"],

Cell[TextData[{
