  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "ab5d7b7c-3647-49a3-9618-bfc3e9731ea1"],
 " (InfraGeometry)",
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the named undirected substrates"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"280e4525-71d6-4d66-9b07-139079850a32"]
}, Open  ]],

